OL,3,GNEWSA'Friends think we're idiots for
OL,4,Areturning to Ukraine'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Russian forces launched a
OL,7,Ffull-scale invasion of Ukraine in
OL,8,FFebruary 2022, John Holmes ` a British
OL,9,Fnational ` and his Ukrainian wife
OL,10,FLiliya fled the port city of Odesa,
OL,11,Ffearing for their lives.
OL,13,FBut after four years in the UK, the
OL,14,Fdraw of home has proven too strong and
OL,15,Fthey have returned to Ukraine's third
OL,16,Flargest city, undeterred by the
OL,17,Fsustained threat of air raids.
OL,19,F"Friends of ours thought we were idiots
OL,20,Ffor going back to Ukraine," reflects
OL,21,FJohn, 74. "But returning is something
OL,22,Fwe felt we needed to do.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
