OL,3,GNEWSA'Friends think we're idiots for
OL,4,Areturning to Ukraine'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Yes, it's dangerous. Yes, there are
OL,7,Fdrones flying overhead. Yes, you can
OL,8,Fhear the explosions. But you just have
OL,9,Fto get on with life as best you can.
